            <h3>The Yarzeh Mansions</h3>
            <div class="pcard-meta"><span>Delivery <b>Dec 2027</b></span><span>Sizes <b>445–690 m²</b></span></div>
            <p>Two stone mansions holding four grand residences of 445 to 690 m², ten minutes from Beirut. Private gardens, rooftop suites, and a shared pool, gym, sauna and steam room.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/projects/yarzeh-mansions/">View residences</a>
          </div>
