            <a class="text-link" href="/projects/louayzeh-village/">View residences</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard soon reveal" aria-label="Saint Paul Gardens — coming soon">
          <div class="pcard-media">
            <img src="/media/projects/saintpaul/saint-paul-gardens.jpg" alt="Aerial render of Saint Paul Gardens among the trees of the Côte d'Azur" loading="lazy">
            <span class="pcard-badge">Coming soon</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-body">
            <span class="pcard-loc">France · Côte d'Azur</span>
            <h3>Saint Paul Gardens</h3>
            <p>A private collection of garden residences on the Côte d'Azur.</p>
            <span class="soon-note">Sales opening soon</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard soon reveal" aria-label="Alma Verde Residences — coming soon">
          <div class="pcard-media">
            <img src="/media/projects/almaverde/pool.jpg" alt="Pool and sun deck at the heart of Alma Verde Residences" loading="lazy">
            <span class="pcard-badge">Coming soon</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-body">
            <span class="pcard-loc">Portugal</span>
            <h3>Alma Verde Residences</h3>
            <p>Garden residences arranged around a central pool and private club.</p>
            <span class="soon-note">Sales opening soon</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard reveal">
          <a class="pcard-cover" href="/projects/pride-of-jamhour/" aria-label="View Pride of Jamhour"></a>
          <div class="pcard-media">
            <img src="/media/projects/jamhour/facade.jpg" alt="The stone and white blocks of Pride of Jamhour" loading="lazy">
            <span class="pcard-badge sold">Delivered &amp; Sold Out</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-body">
            <span class="pcard-loc">Jamhour, Lebanon</span>
            <h3>Pride of Jamhour</h3>
            <p>24,000 m² of greenery above Beirut with tennis, volleyball, basketball and mini football courts, two pools and a modern gym. Apartments of 96 m² and duplexes of 160 m².</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/projects/pride-of-jamhour/">View residences</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="pcard reveal">
          <a class="pcard-cover" href="/projects/yarzeh-townhouses/" aria-label="View The Yarzeh Townhouses"></a>
          <div class="pcard-media">
            <img src="/media/projects/townhouses/night-pools.jpg" alt="The lit pools between the two mansions of the Yarzeh Townhouses at night" loading="lazy">
            <span class="pcard-badge sold">Delivered &amp; Sold Out</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard-body">
            <span class="pcard-loc">Yarzeh · Baabda, Lebanon</span>
            <h3>The Yarzeh Townhouses</h3>
            <p>Six townhouses across two mansions, Redwood and Magnolia, each home with its own garden and character, plus a pool, jacuzzi, gym, sauna and steam room per mansion.</p>
